Strong Final Interview Answer

Snowpark-Optimized Warehouses are specialized Snowflake virtual warehouses designed for memory-intensive workloads such as Snowpark Python, machine learning, AI, and large DataFrame processing. Unlike standard warehouses, they provide significantly more memory per node, improving performance and reducing out-of-memory issues for ML and Python workloads. They are created using the WAREHOUSE_TYPE='SNOWPARK-OPTIMIZED' parameter and are best suited for advanced analytics rather than traditional SQL reporting workloads.
